1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The ninth process is <i>mengukir</i> (carving).

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:09,240
The tools required would be an array of
knives or <i>anak wali</i> of various sizes.

3
00:00:09,448 --> 00:00:12,448
Also known as abang adik.

4
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:15,220
It consists of three sizes,

5
00:00:15,244 --> 00:00:18,244
slightly large, medium and small.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Its application depends on the area which we will be carving

7
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:35,240
and according to the type and size of flowers
or leaves that we have designed.
